<p id="S4.p12.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p12.1.1" class="ltx_text">The proof follows identically to Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmthm2" title="Theorem 4.2. ‣ 4 Stability of Convolution ‣ Four Function Theorems Through Optimal Transport and Entropic Analogs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
