</table>
<p id="S6.p8.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.p8.5.1" class="ltx_text">so <math id="S6.p8.m37" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L^{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L^{1}</annotation></semantics></math> convergence on the bounded set <math id="S6.p8.m38" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math> also gives convergence of
