<div id="S6.p9" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text">Choose <math id="S6.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{k}\uparrow\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">↑</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{k}\uparrow\infty</annotation></semantics></math>. On the common ball</span></p>
