<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S6.p9.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.p9.2.1" class="ltx_text">choose the <math id="S6.p9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>-th smoothing <math id="S6.p9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nu^{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>ν</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nu^{k}</annotation></semantics></math> so that</span></p>
