</table>
<p id="S6.p26.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.p26.2.1" class="ltx_text">Combining (<a href="#S6.E17" title="In Proof of Theorem . ‣ 6 A transport proof of the min–max entropy inequality ‣ Four Function Theorems Through Optimal Transport and Entropic Analogs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a>) and (<a href="#S6.E18" title="In Proof of Theorem . ‣ 6 A transport proof of the min–max entropy inequality ‣ Four Function Theorems Through Optimal Transport and Entropic Analogs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a>) (and observing the cancellation of the second-moment terms due to (<a href="#S6.E19" title="In Proof of Theorem . ‣ 6 A transport proof of the min–max entropy inequality ‣ Four Function Theorems Through Optimal Transport and Entropic Analogs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">19</span></a>)), we obtain</span></p>
