<div id="S6.p28" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.p28.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.p28.1.1" class="ltx_text">Relative entropy with respect to the probability measure <math id="S6.p28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math> is
lower semicontinuous under weak convergence. Hence</span></p>
